るある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとも、\n私だけでしょうか？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログで出した\n二期生のレッスン風景の写真。\n何踊ってるかクイズ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集計しました～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/26/4273783/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位  ぐるぐるカーテン\n君の名は希望\n3位  左胸の勇気\n4位  走れ!bysicle\n5位  乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解は～..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左胸の勇気"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/26/4273783/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しいと思ったのに\n正解者結構いてびっくり～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/26/4273783/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/26/4273783/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/26/4273783/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/26/4273783/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/b